<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56610" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεντ-έω</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
			Pi.
			<u>P.</u>
			1.28
		</span></i>, etc.: fut. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ήσω</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			S.
			<u>Aj.</u>
			1245
		</span></i>: aor.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκέντησα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Epid.</u>
					5.45
				</span></i>
			, 
				Dor.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέντᾱσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					19.1
				</span></i>
			; 
				Ep.
			inf.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κένσαι</span>
			(as if from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κέντω</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				23.337
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, fut. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ηθήσομαι
				</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγ</span>-) <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.29
			</span></i>: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκεντήθην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Spir.</u>
					483b16
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.15.3
			</span></i>: pf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεκέντημαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Anat.</u>
					1
				</span></i>
			:—<i>prick, goad, spur on</i>, Il.l.c., <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				1300
			</span></i>, etc.: prov., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τὸν πῶλον περὶ
				τὴν νύσσαν</span>, of impetuous haste, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of bees and wasps,
				<i>sting</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				226
			</span></i>, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἔρωτα κακὰ κέντασε
			μέλισσα</span> Theoc.l.c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὠφθαλμὼ κεντούμενος ὥσπερ ὑπ᾽
					ἀνθρηνῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Nu.</u>
					947
				</span></i>
			; of the porcupine, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				12.26
			</span></i>: then, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			generally, <i>prick, stab</i>, Pi.l.c., <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				15.130
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηδ᾽ ὀλωλότα κέντει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					1030
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν γλῶσσαν καὶ τὴν ψυχὴν αὐτῶν
					κέντησον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Tab.Defix.</u>
					97.26
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκέντει . . &lt;αἰθέρ᾽&gt;, ὡς
					σφάζων ἐμέ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					631
				</span></i>
			 (troch.), etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τὸν
			ἀέρα</span> Theo Sm.<i><span class="en">
				p.61
			</span></i> H., cf. <i><span class="en">
				p.72
			</span></i> H.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τύπτειν οὐδὲ κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Grg.</u>
					456d
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεντηθείσης τῆς
			φλεβός</span> Thphr.l.c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παιομένους καὶ κεντουμένους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					4.47
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαστιγούμενος καὶ κεντούμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					3.3.11
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>An.</u>
				3.1.29
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σὺν δόλῳ κ.</span>
			<i>stab</i> in the dark, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				1245
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιμῷ κεντούμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alciphr.
					3.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βινέω</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Mnesim.
				4.55
			</span></i>.</div>
